   "tone": "note",
   "headline": "Move the camera, zoom against it, match the speed",
   "highlight": "Two moves that cancel on the subject only",
   "summary": "On a track, roll away while zooming in, or roll in while zooming out. Whatever is at the focus distance holds still. Everything behind it changes size.",
